      "node_id": "kg_doc_4",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "The Halliburton Company, an American multinational corporation. One of the world's largest oil field service companies, it has operations in more than 70 countries. It owns hundreds of subsidiaries, affiliates, branches, brands, and divisions worldwide and employs approximately 50,000 people.",
